  "description": "VIMNOW crystallizes in the rhombohedral crystal system with space group R -3. Reported CIF formula moiety: C126 H104 Dy10 N13 O54 1+,N1 O3 1-. From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 12 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2A (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2B (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy1I (Dy) has 12 O neighbors; Dy2I (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy3I (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2J (Dy) has 8 O neighbors; Dy2K (Dy) has 8 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 18 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.602-3.795 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 99.20-112.36°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [DyIII10O2(OH)6(o-van)6(ISO)13(H2O)2](NO3). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 6 OH (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 2 H2O (explicit grouped unit in article formula), 1 NO3 (explicit grouped unit in article formula). Article name explicitly identifies Dy(III).",
